      "text": "API\n* Upload: POST /file Request {file, fileMetadata}\n* Download: GET /files/{fileId} (file, fileMetadata)\n* SHare: POST /files/{fileId}/share\n* change: GET /files/changes?since={timestamp} \n--> changeEvent[]",
