      "updated": 1782171685930,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Split the data model into durable document state and ephemeral session state. \nModel the scene graph as a tree of SceneElements (FRAME, TEXT, RECTANGLE, IMAGE) \non a Page that carries both an elementsMap for O(1) lookup and a doubly-linked list for cheap reordering, \nwith children nested on container frames. Keep viewport, selection, tool, \nfocus, and in-progress InteractionState inside CanvasState, \nand keep CanvasState out of the serialized document so saved files, history entries, and multiplayer merges stay clean.",
      "fontSize": 10.914193354852056,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Split the data model into durable document state and ephemeral session state. \nModel the scene graph as a tree of SceneElements (FRAME, TEXT, RECTANGLE, IMAGE) \non a Page that carries both an elementsMap for O(1) lookup and a doubly-linked list for cheap reordering, \nwith children nested on container frames. Keep viewport, selection, tool, \nfocus, and in-progress InteractionState inside CanvasState, \nand keep CanvasState out of the serialized document so saved files, history entries, and multiplayer merges stay clean.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
